=== Known follow-up (NOT a Phase 2.1 gate) ===
java.lang.RuntimeException: Fontconfig head is null, check your fonts or fonts configuration
  at net.runelite.client.ui.FontManager.<clinit>(FontManager.java:88)

— Termux doesn't ship `fontconfig` or system fonts by default. The proot-Ubuntu path has both (apt installs pulled them in during the original bootstrap).
— Phase 3 prep: `pkg install fontconfig` and install a TTF font under Termux before attempting FPS A/B at Varrock East Bank.
— This is NOT a Phase 2.1 blocker: the spec exit gate is "JVM starts and loads RL mainClass with the Bionic jar", which is proved by the banner + class-load log above.

